    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61545" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾰγώβολ-ον</span></b>  (parox.), τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>staff</i> or
